OL,3,AFour victims named in Canada military
OL,4,Abase fire as officials say 39 people
OL,5,Ataken to hospital
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour soldiers killed after a major fire
OL,8,Fat a Canadian military base have been
OL,9,Fnamed, as officials say another 39
OL,10,Fpeople were taken to hospital
OL,12,FAt least 19 of those in hospital are in
OL,13,Fa critical condition after a grass fire
OL,14,Fspread on Saturday, officials say
OL,16,FCarney says the "violent, fast-moving"
OL,17,Ffire led to "one of the worst
OL,18,Ftragedies" for the military in
OL,19,Fpeacetime
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
