OL,3,AFour victims named in Canada military
OL,4,Abase fire as officials say 39 people
OL,5,Ataken to hospital
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It was like a scene out of a war
OL,8,Fmovie," says a hospital resident who
OL,9,Fwitnessed a military vehicle and
OL,10,Fambulances bringing injured people in
OL,12,FCanadian Forces Base Wainwright, where
OL,13,Fthe fire broke out about 16:00 local
OL,14,Ftime (22:00 GMT) on Saturday, is one of
OL,15,Fthe country's busiest military training
OL,16,Fbases
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
