OL,3,AWhat we know so far about deadly fire
OL,4,Aat Canadian military base
OL,5,
OL,6,FA huge fire swept through a Canadian
OL,7,Fmilitary base on Saturday, killing at
OL,8,Fleast four people and leaving 19 people
OL,9,Fin critical condition.
OL,11,FPrime Minister Mark Carney described it
OL,12,Fas one of the worst peace time
OL,13,Ftragedies on Canadian soil in the
OL,14,Fhistory of the military.
OL,16,FHere is what we know about the deadly
OL,17,Fincident so far.
OL,19,FThe fire at Canadian Forces Base
OL,20,FWainwright broke out at around 16:00
OL,21,Flocal time (22:00 GMT).
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
