OL,3,ATrump says suspension of Russia
OL,4,Asanctions is to keep peace negotiations
OL,5,Agoing
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump blocked numerous sanctions on
OL,8,FRussia two days before they were due to
OL,9,Ftake effect, as a row with Ukrainian
OL,10,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky deepened.
OL,12,FZelensky told NBC News on Sunday that
OL,13,Fsiding with Russian President Vladimir
OL,14,FPutin would be a "historic mistake".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
